#: NAVIGATION.md:1
msgid "hybrid Small Angle Scattering — hands-on guide"
msgstr "hybrid Small Angle Scattering — 実習ガイド"

#: NAVIGATION.md:3
msgid ""
"This guide is designed to provide users with practical advice on using the "
"hySAS module. For theoretical information about the method, please refer to "
"the related "
"[manuscript](https://pubs.acs.org/doi/full/10.1021/acs.jctc.3c00864). The "
"guide is divided into several sections:"
msgstr ""
"hySAS の実践的な使い方を説明します。理論は関連 "
"[論文](https://pubs.acs.org/doi/full/10.1021/acs.jctc.3c00864) "
"を参照してください。次の節があります。"

#: NAVIGATION.md:5
msgid "[hySAS Intro & Overview](intro.md)"
msgstr "[hySAS の導入と概要](intro.md)"

#: NAVIGATION.md:6
msgid ""
"A brief introduction to the method, basic concepts, and an overview of the "
"analyses that can be performed."
msgstr "手法、基本概念、可能な解析の簡単な紹介。"

