msgid ""
"From coordinates to a SAS curve: steps and examples to analyse a PDB file or"
" a trajectory."
msgstr "座標から SAS Curve へ：PDB・Trajectory 解析の手順と例。"

#: NAVIGATION.md:11
msgid "[Generating a Conformational Ensemble with GMX and hySAS](02.md)"
msgstr "[GMX と hySAS による Conformational Ensemble の生成](02.md)"

#: NAVIGATION.md:12
msgid ""
"Combining GROMACS and PLUMED to generate conformational ensembles restrained"
